abstract: >-
  Code and data of Chapter 4 of the doctoral thesis: sequential Bayesian calibration, model selection and
  predictive validation of ordinary differential equation models of triple-negative breast cancer in 4T1
  and RR-4T1 murine tumors under radiotherapy, immunotherapy and their combination, including the
  incorporation of the standardized uptake value of [89Zr]-CD8 PET into the immune-mediated lysis term
  and its leave-one-out predictive assessment.
keywords:
  - mathematical oncology
  - triple-negative breast cancer
  - radiotherapy
  - immunotherapy
  - Bayesian calibration
  - model selection
  - immunoPET
  - leave-one-out cross-validation
